## 💡 Quick Tips
1. **Try the Ken Burns transition** along with **Anime Boost** color grading. It makes the static images look like a professional anime montage.
2. **Enable the Lofi Anime Beat** soundtrack while playing to experience synthesized ambient beats synced to the playhead.
3. Click **Export MP4/WebM Video** to save your creation to your machine. The exporter runs client-side and compiles your timeline and music into a single file!
